<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover">
<title>The Grand Budapest Hotel</title>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Jost:wght@400;500;600&family=Cormorant+Garamond:ital,wght@0,500;1,500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
:root{
  --pink:#F4B9C8; --rose:#E58AA6; --cream:#FBEBD0; --plum:#4B2A4F; --lav:#9A8AB8;
  --red:#8E1B2C; --gold:#D9A441; --ink:#3A1F3D;
  --head:'Jost','Futura','Century Gothic',sans-serif;
  --serif:'Cormorant Garamond','Garamond',Georgia,serif;
  box-sizing:border-box;
  padding-top:env(safe-area-inset-top,0px);padding-bottom:env(safe-area-inset-bottom,0px);
}
*,*::before,*::after{box-sizing:inherit}
html{scroll-behavior:smooth;scroll-padding-top:64px}
body{margin:0;background:var(--cream);color:var(--ink);font-family:var(--serif);font-size:20px;line-height:1.6;text-align:center}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){html{scroll-behavior:auto}}
a{color:inherit}
a:focus-visible,button:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--gold);outline-offset:3px}

/* nav */
nav{position:sticky;top:env(safe-area-inset-top,0px);z-index:10;background:var(--plum);border-bottom:4px double var(--gold);display:flex;justify-content:center;gap:clamp(.8rem,3vw,2.2rem);padding:.9rem 1rem;flex-wrap:wrap}
nav a{font-family:var(--head);font-size:.78rem;letter-spacing:.22em;text-transform:uppercase;text-decoration:none;color:var(--cream)}
nav a:hover{color:var(--gold)}

section{padding:clamp(4rem,9vw,7rem) 1.5rem}
.wrap{max-width:900px;margin:0 auto}
h1,h2,h3{font-family:var(--head);font-weight:500;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.14em;line-height:1.25;margin:0}
h2{font-size:clamp(1.5rem,4vw,2.4rem)}
h3{font-size:1.05rem;letter-spacing:.2em}
.rule{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:1rem;margin:1.6rem auto;max-width:420px}
.rule::before,.rule::after{content:"";flex:1;border-top:2px solid currentColor;border-bottom:2px solid currentColor;height:6px;opacity:.7}
.rule i{width:10px;height:10px;background:currentColor;transform:rotate(45deg)}

/* placeholder copy */
.ph{display:grid;gap:.7rem;justify-items:center;margin:1.5rem auto;max-width:600px}
.ph span{display:block;height:.7rem;background:currentColor;opacity:.2;border-radius:2px}
.ph span:nth-child(1){width:100%}.ph span:nth-child(2){width:94%}.ph span:nth-child(3){width:78%}
.tag{font-style:italic;font-size:1.5rem;display:block;width:min(420px,80%);height:1.2rem;margin:1.2rem auto;background:currentColor;opacity:.25;border-radius:2px}

/* frames: symmetrical, arched */
.frame{border:3px solid var(--gold);outline:3px solid var(--plum);outline-offset:5px;background:var(--pink)}
.photo{aspect-ratio:3/4;background:var(--rose);border:3px solid var(--gold);outline:3px solid var(--plum);outline-offset:5px;border-radius:999px 999px 0 0;display:grid;place-items:center;color:var(--plum);font-family:var(--head);font-size:.7rem;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase}
.photo.wide{aspect-ratio:4/3;border-radius:0}

/* 1 hero */
#home{background:var(--pink);color:var(--plum);padding-bottom:0;overflow:hidden}
#home .small{font-family:var(--head);font-size:.8rem;letter-spacing:.4em;text-transform:uppercase}
#home h1{font-size:clamp(2rem,7vw,4.6rem);letter-spacing:.12em;margin:1rem 0}
.facade{margin:3rem auto 0;width:min(760px,100%);aspect-ratio:760/330;position:relative}
.facade div{position:absolute;background:var(--rose);border:3px solid var(--plum);bottom:0}
.facade .c{left:30%;right:30%;top:0;border-radius:6px 6px 0 0}
.facade .m{left:15%;right:15%;top:30%}
.facade .s{left:0;right:0;top:58%;background:var(--red)}
.facade .door{left:44%;right:44%;top:70%;background:var(--plum);border-radius:999px 999px 0 0;border-color:var(--gold)}
.facade .win{border:none;height:14%;width:7%;background:var(--cream);top:12%;border-radius:999px 999px 0 0;bottom:auto}
.facade .win.a{left:36%}.facade .win.b{left:46.5%}.facade .win.c2{left:57%}
.facade .win.d{top:40%;left:22%}.facade .win.e{top:40%;left:71%}.facade .win.f{top:40%;left:46.5%}
.facade .win.g{top:66%;left:8%;background:var(--pink)}.facade .win.h{top:66%;left:85%;background:var(--pink)}

/* 2 experience */
#experience{background:var(--cream);color:var(--plum)}
.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:2.2rem;margin-top:3rem}
.grid .item h3{margin:1.4rem 0 .4rem;font-size:.9rem}

/* 3 history */
#history{background:var(--plum);color:var(--cream)}
.tl{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:2.5rem;margin-top:3rem;position:relative}
.tl::before{content:"";position:absolute;left:50%;top:0;bottom:0;border-left:2px solid var(--gold)}
.tl>div{padding:0 1rem}
.tl .dot{width:14px;height:14px;background:var(--gold);transform:rotate(45deg);margin:0 auto 1rem}
.sub{margin-top:4rem;padding:2rem;border:3px double var(--gold)}
.sub h3{color:var(--gold)}

/* 4 concierge */
#concierge{background:var(--cream);color:var(--plum)}
.pair{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:3rem;margin-top:3rem}
.pair .photo{max-width:300px;margin:0 auto}
.pair h3{margin:1.6rem 0 .3rem}
.tags{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.6rem;justify-content:center;margin-top:1.2rem}
.tags span{width:90px;height:1.7rem;border:2px solid var(--gold);border-radius:999px;background:var(--pink)}

/* 5 today */
#today{background:var(--lav);color:var(--ink)}
.band{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:1.5rem;margin-top:3rem}
.band .frame{padding:1.8rem 1rem;background:var(--cream)}

/* 6 reviews */
#reviews{background:var(--red);color:var(--cream)}
.rev{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:2rem;margin-top:3rem}
.rev .card{background:var(--cream);color:var(--plum);padding:2rem 1.4rem;border:3px solid var(--gold);outline:3px solid var(--cream);outline-offset:5px}
.stars{color:var(--gold);letter-spacing:.3em;font-size:1.2rem}
.who{display:block;width:50%;height:.6rem;background:var(--plum);opacity:.45;margin:1rem auto 0;border-radius:2px}

/* 7 cta */
#book{background:var(--pink);color:var(--plum)}
.btn{display:inline-block;margin-top:1.5rem;padding:1.1rem 2.6rem;background:var(--plum);color:var(--cream);font-family:var(--head);font-size:.85rem;letter-spacing:.3em;text-transform:uppercase;text-decoration:none;border:3px solid var(--gold);outline:3px solid var(--plum);outline-offset:5px;transition:background .2s,color .2s}
.btn:hover{background:var(--gold);color:var(--plum)}
footer{background:var(--plum);color:var(--cream);padding:2.5rem 1.5rem;font-family:var(--head);font-size:.7rem;letter-spacing:.3em;text-transform:uppercase}

@media (max-width:760px){
  .grid,.band,.rev,.pair{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .tl{grid-template-columns:1fr}.tl::before{display:none}
  body{font-size:18px}
}
@media (prefers-color-scheme:dark){
  :root:not([data-theme="light"]){color-scheme:light}
}

p{max-width:640px;margin:1rem auto}
.st{font-style:italic;font-size:1.35rem;margin:.8rem auto}
.pull{font-size:1.6rem;font-style:italic;margin:3rem auto 0;color:var(--gold)}
.big{font-size:1.5rem;font-style:italic}
.btns{display:flex;gap:1.4rem;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:1.5rem}
.btns .btn{margin-top:0}
.btn.alt{background:transparent;color:var(--plum)}
.btn.alt:hover{background:var(--gold)}
#experience .item p{font-size:1rem}
.card p{margin:1rem auto;font-size:1.05rem}
.card b{font-family:var(--head);font-weight:500;font-size:.78rem;letter-spacing:.15em;text-transform:uppercase}
.note{font-size:.95rem;font-style:italic;margin-top:2.5rem;opacity:.9}
.pair h3{margin-bottom:.2rem}
#today .frame{padding:2.5rem 1.5rem}
@media(min-width:761px){.rev{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}}
.photo{overflow:hidden}.photo img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;display:block}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<nav aria-label="Main">
<a href="#home">Home</a><a href="#experience">Experience</a><a href="#history">History</a><a href="#concierge">Concierge</a><a href="#today">Today</a><a href="#reviews">Reviews</a><a href="#book">Reserve</a>
</nav>

<section id="home">
<div class="wrap">
<h1>The Grand Budapest Hotel</h1>
<div class="rule"><i></i></div>
<p class="st">Where the golden age never quite ended</p>
<p class="lede">Luxury. Tradition. Impeccable discretion.</p>
<p>Nestled among the snow capped peaks of the Republic of Zubrowka, the Grand Budapest Hotel welcomes discerning travellers into a world of unparalleled elegance. From our signature pink facade to our exquisitely appointed suites, every detail has been carefully preserved to evoke an era when hospitality was an art and every guest was treated as royalty.</p>
<p>For generations, our hotel has stood as a symbol of refinement, attracting distinguished visitors from across Europe and beyond. Though the world beyond our mountain sanctuary has changed considerably, we remain committed to preserving the traditions that made us legendary.</p>
<p class="big">Experience the extraordinary. Revisit the unforgettable.</p>
<div class="btns"><a class="btn alt" href="#experience">Explore our rooms</a><a class="btn" href="#book">Reserve your stay</a></div>
</div>
<div class="facade" role="img" aria-label="Illustration of a symmetrical pink hotel facade">
<div class="s"></div><div class="m"></div><div class="c"></div>
<div class="win a"></div><div class="win b"></div><div class="win c2"></div>
<div class="win d"></div><div class="win e"></div><div class="win f"></div>
<div class="win g"></div><div class="win h"></div>
<div class="door"></div>
</div>
</section>

<section id="experience">
<div class="wrap">
<h2>The Grand Experience</h2>
<div class="rule"><i></i></div>
<p class="st">A world apart from the ordinary</p>
<p class="big">At the Grand Budapest, luxury is not merely offered, it is orchestrated.</p>
<div class="grid">
<div class="item"><div class="photo wide"><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Pink hotel corridor with a red carpet" style="object-position:50% 50%"></div><h3>Exquisite Accommodation</h3><p>Retreat into rooms adorned with velvet furnishings, ornate wallpaper and carefully selected antiques. Our signature suites preserve the romantic grandeur of a more gracious age, offering guests the rare privilege of waking up surrounded by history.</p></div>
<div class="item"><div class="photo wide"><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Hotel staff lined up in front of a mountain backdrop" style="object-position:50% 50%"></div><h3>Impeccable Service</h3><p>Our dedicated staff anticipate your every need before you have the opportunity to express it. From the careful arrangement of your luggage to the precise timing of your afternoon refreshments, no detail is too insignificant for our attention.</p></div>
<div class="item"><div class="photo wide"><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Breakfast and tea table by an open balcony window" style="object-position:50% 60%"></div><h3>The Afternoon Tea Experience</h3><p>Indulge in delicate pastries, fine teas and elegant conversation beneath the chandeliers of our historic dining room. Our traditional service celebrates the rituals of an era when appearances mattered, manners were essential and every occasion deserved its own silver tray.</p></div>
<div class="item"><div class="photo wide"><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="The pink hotel on a snowy mountainside" style="object-position:50% 15%"></div><h3>Alpine Views</h3><p>Beyond our windows, the Zubrowkan mountains offer a breathtaking panorama of snow, pine forests and distant villages. Whether blanketed in winter white or illuminated by the summer sun, the landscape provides a timeless backdrop to your stay.</p></div>
<div class="item"><div class="photo wide"><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Red lobby with a grand staircase and concierge desk" style="object-position:50% 50%"></div><h3>A Standard Beyond Compare</h3><p>Our philosophy is simple, excellence must be visible in everything. Every cushion is placed with intention. Every greeting is delivered with warmth. Every guest is made to feel important.</p></div>
<div class="item" style="display:grid;align-content:center"><p class="big">After all, perfection is a matter of practice.</p></div>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section id="history">
<div class="wrap">
<h2>A History Worth Preserving</h2>
<div class="rule"><i></i></div>
<p class="st">An institution. An era. A legend.</p>
<p>Established during the height of European aristocratic society, the Grand Budapest Hotel quickly became a favoured retreat for royalty, wealthy patrons, celebrated writers and other distinguished guests. Its reputation rested not only upon its magnificent architecture but upon a particular understanding of hospitality, that every individual deserved dignity, regardless of the circumstances beyond our doors.</p>
<p>During its celebrated golden age, the hotel flourished under the guidance of Monsieur Gustave H., whose extraordinary standards transformed ordinary service into something approaching an art form.</p>
<p class="pull">Yet history rarely remains as elegant as its portraits suggest.</p>
<div class="sub">
<p>The twentieth century brought profound changes to Zubrowka. Political unrest, shifting social hierarchies and the arrival of increasingly restrictive authorities altered the world in which the hotel had once prospered. Borders changed. Familiar traditions disappeared. The grand halls that had once welcomed society's most influential figures witnessed a very different chapter of European history.</p>
<p>Our archives preserve these years with the discretion appropriate to a distinguished institution. Certain periods are best understood through their surviving architecture, personal correspondence and carefully maintained records.</p>
<p>Today, we honour the resilience of our building and the generations who passed through its door. We believe that heritage deserves to be preserved, even when the past itself is less straightforward than the stories told about it.</p>
<p class="big" style="color:var(--gold)">The world may change. A legend endures.</p>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section id="concierge">
<div class="wrap">
<h2>Meet Our Legendary Concierge</h2>
<div class="rule"><i></i></div>
<div class="pair">
<div>
<div class="photo"><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Monsieur Gustave H." style="object-position:50% 15%"></div>
<h3 style="margin-top:1.6rem">Monsieur Gustave H.</h3>
<p class="st">The art of being unforgettable</p>
<p>Few individuals have shaped the Grand Budapest's reputation as profoundly as Monsieur Gustave H.</p>
<p>Renowned for his immaculate appearance, exquisite manners and uncompromising professional standards, Gustave understood that a concierge's responsibilities extended far beyond the exchange of keys. He offered conversation, comfort, poetry and when circumstances demanded it, a remarkable degree of personal devotion.</p>
<p>A connoisseur of fine perfume and literature, he believed that refinement was not determined solely by wealth or social position but by one's conduct towards others.</p>
<p>His loyalty to the hotel's guests was legendary. So too was his insistence that every person within its walls be treated with dignity. Even in an age defined by rigid class distinctions, Gustave possessed an unusual ability to recognise humanity where others saw status.</p>
<p>His partnership with the young Zero Moustafa, originally employed as a lobby boy, became one of the most enduring relationships in the hotel's history. Through mentorship, shared hardship and mutual loyalty, the two formed a bond that transcended their differences in age and social standing.</p>
<p class="big">Monsieur Gustave taught us that true service is remembered long after the formalities have been forgotten.</p>
</div>
<div>
<div class="photo"><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Zero Moustafa" style="object-position:50% 30%"></div>
<h3 style="margin-top:1.6rem">Zero Moustafa</h3>
<p class="st">A legacy of loyalty</p>
<p>Every great institution depends upon the people who sustain it.</p>
<p>Zero's journey from inexperienced lobby boy to a figure of lasting importance within the hotel's history embodies our enduring commitment to dedication, discipline and personal growth. His story reminds us that a person's significance cannot always be measured by their title, their origins or the circumstances into which they are born.</p>
<p class="big">Some of our most valuable traditions are not written into our manuals. They are carried by the people who remember them.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section id="today">
<div class="wrap">
<h2>The Grand Budapest Today</h2>
<div class="rule"><i></i></div>
<p class="st">Preserving yesterday. Welcoming tomorrow.</p>
<div class="frame">
<p class="big">Time leaves its mark upon every institution. The Grand Budapest is no exception.</p>
<p>Our contemporary experience celebrates the architectural character, decorative splendour and service traditions that distinguish our heritage. Through carefully curated interiors, archival displays and thoughtfully restored spaces, guests may encounter the atmosphere of the hotel's celebrated past.</p>
<p>We invite you to explore the stories behind our furnishings, discover the individuals who shaped our reputation and experience the enduring elegance of our historic surroundings.</p>
<p>We recognise that preservation is not simply the restoration of beautiful objects. It is also the responsibility of acknowledging the lives, relationships and changing circumstances that gave those objects meaning.</p>
<p>Some chapters of our history remain imperfectly understood. Others survive only through the memories of those who witnessed them.</p>
<p class="big">We preserve what remains, while recognising what has been lost.</p>
</div>
<p class="st" style="margin-top:2.5rem">A historic destination. An evolving story.</p>
</div>
</section>

<section id="reviews">
<div class="wrap">
<h2>Guest Reviews</h2>
<div class="rule"><i></i></div>
<p class="st">Unforgettable stays. Enduring impressions.</p>
<div class="rev">
<div class="card"><div class="stars" aria-label="Five stars">★★★★★</div><p>“The pink exterior is absolutely enchanting and the service was positively aristocratic. For a few days, I felt transported to another century. One almost forgot how much the world has changed beyond those beautiful windows.”</p><b>Eleanor W., London</b></div>
<div class="card"><div class="stars" aria-label="Five stars">★★★★★</div><p>“A remarkable experience. The staff were attentive, the afternoon tea exquisite and the historical displays fascinating. I was particularly struck by the hotel's ability to make such turbulent decades feel wonderfully distant.”</p><b>Thomas R., Vienna</b></div>
<div class="card"><div class="stars" aria-label="Four stars">★★★★☆</div><p>“The hotel is breathtaking, although its history is rather more complicated than the brochures suggest. The elegant rooms and the old photographs create a romantic atmosphere but some of the stories behind them are difficult to forget. I would recommend visiting the archives as well as the spa.”</p><b>Isabelle M., Paris</b></div>
<div class="card"><div class="stars" aria-label="Five stars">★★★★★</div><p>“Monsieur Gustave was a gentleman in every sense of the word. He remembered my preferred perfume, anticipated my every request and treated me with a kindness I shall never forget. There was nowhere in Europe quite like the Grand Budapest.”</p><b>Anonymous, 1932</b></div>
</div>
<p class="note">Guest recollections have been edited for clarity and preserved in keeping with our archival standards.</p>
</div>
</section>

<section id="book">
<div class="wrap">
<h2>Your Story Begins Here</h2>
<div class="rule"><i></i></div>
<p class="st">Become a part of our history</p>
<p>The Grand Budapest Hotel invites you to experience a world of extraordinary beauty, exceptional hospitality and enduring tradition.</p>
<p>Walk the corridors once travelled by distinguished guests. Discover the elegance of a vanished age. Experience the rituals that transformed a mountain hotel into a European legend.</p>
<p class="big">The past cannot be recovered in its entirety. But for a little while it can be experienced.</p>
<p>The Grand Budapest Hotel – where every stay becomes a story and every story becomes part of our history.</p>
<a class="btn" href="#book">Reserve your stay today</a>
<p class="note">We look forward to welcoming you</p>
</div>
</section>
</body>
</html>
